#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:16
msgid ""
"Bridgend Astronomical Society - Jupiter's Moons Orbital Simulation v20250707"
msgstr "布里真德天文协会——木星卫星轨道模拟（2025年7月7日）"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:17
msgid ""
"Note: Jupiter may not actually be visible from your location at this time."
msgstr "注意：木星此时不一定能从您所在的位置看到。"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:19
msgid ""
"There are 95 moons of Jupiter with confirmed orbits as of 5 February 2024."
msgstr "截至2024年2月5日，木星已有95颗卫星确认拥有轨道。"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:21
msgid ""
"The most massive of the moons are the four Galilean moons (may not be "
"visible if behind Jupiter in their orbit):"
msgstr "其中质量最大的卫星是四颗伽利略卫星（运行到木星背面时可能不可见）："

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:24
msgid ""
"Io ( Jupiter I ), innermost and second smallest of the four. Has over 400 "
"active volcanoes. "
msgstr "木卫一（木星I），四颗卫星中最靠内、第二小的一颗，拥有400多座活火山。"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:30
msgid ""
"Europa ( Jupiter II ), smallest of the four and the closest icy moon to "
"Jupiter. "
msgstr "木卫二（木星II），四颗卫星中最小的一颗，也是距离木星最近的冰质卫星。"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:36
msgid "Ganymede ( Jupiter III ), Largest moon in the solar system. "
msgstr "木卫三（木星III），太阳系中最大的卫星。"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:42
msgid ""
"and Callisto ( Jupiter IV ), second largest moon of Jupiter and heavily "
"cratered. "
msgstr "木卫四（木星IV），木星第二大卫星，表面遍布陨石坑。"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:50
msgid ""
"BAS - Jupiter's Moons Orbital Simulation will now run.  (use the << >> menu "
"options to adjust speed of sim.)"
msgstr ""
"布里真德天文协会的木星卫星轨道模拟即将开始。（使用“<<”“>>”菜单选项调整模拟速"
"度。）"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:61
msgid "Simulation now complete"
msgstr "模拟完成"

#: scripts/BAS_Jupiter_Moons.ssc:63
msgid "Display will restore previous config."
msgstr "显示设置将恢复到之前的配置。"

#: scripts/BAS_Messier_Tour.ssc:138
